meta {
  name: Sandbox test patients
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  One request per Predoc sandbox test patient: https://docs.predoc.ai/reference/sandbox-test-patients

  Each request creates the patient with an HIE or medications request, then stores `patientId`.
  Follow up with any `v1/patients` request, e.g. `Patient Requests` or `Get Patient HIE documents`.
}
